---
import Plain from '../../layouts/Plain.astro';
import { counts } from '../../lib/data';
const c = counts();
---
<Plain title="About">
  <p>Edictai is an open record of AI policy in America's schools and colleges. Every law, bill and guidance document is checked against its official source.</p>
  <p>The record currently holds {c.legislation} pieces of legislation, {c.documents} guidance and policy documents and {c.executiveActions} executive actions across {c.states} states and the federal government, sorted into {c.topics} topics.</p>
  <p>All Edictai data is open under CC BY 4.0 and can be downloaded as SQLite, CSV or JSON.</p>
</Plain>
